    <!-- Questions array -->
    <string-array name="faq_questions">
        <item>What is Appsaz?</item>
        <item>Do I need programming knowledge to use Appsaz?</item>
        <item>What types of applications can I create with Appsaz?</item>
        <item>Can the applications I create be sold?</item>
        <item>Can I earn money using Appsaz?</item>
        <item>Is Appsaz free?</item>
        <item>Can I create custom-designed applications?</item>
        <item>How can I contact the support team?</item>
    </string-array>

    <!-- Answers array -->
    <string-array name="faq_answers">
        <item>Appsaz is an innovative tool for creating Android applications without the need for coding. It provides extensive features for designing and developing functional apps.</item>
        <item>No, Appsaz is designed for anyone to easily create their own apps without any prior programming knowledge.</item>
        <item>You can create various types of applications, such as personal, storytelling, educational, gallery, music, video, and more.</item>
        <item>Yes, you can sell the applications you create. Appsaz allows you to publish your apps on various platforms.</item>
        <item>Yes, Appsaz supports AdMob, enabling you to earn money through ads. Additionally, you can sell educational apps created with Appsaz.</item>
        <item>The basic version of Appsaz is free. However, you can upgrade to the professional version for advanced features.</item>
        <item>Yes, Appsaz allows you to fully customize the design and functionality of your applications as desired.</item>
        <item>You can contact the support team via the "About Us" section in the app or through the provided support email.</item>
    </string-array>

