    <string name="a_end_free_trial_title">Free Trial</string>
    <string name="a_end_free_trial">
The free trial of Appsaz has reached its maximum limit for adding files. The current version of Appsaz is a free trial with certain limitations. In this version, users can add up to 20 pages, 10 lists, and 10 fonts to their projects. However, there are no restrictions on adding multimedia files such as images, videos, and audios. Additionally, only Google AdMob banner ads are supported in this version, and the Appsaz watermark is automatically included in the output apps. To unlock all features and remove limitations, users can upgrade to a premium user. This version is currently under development, and for more information or to upgrade, please reach out to our support team through the About Us section.
Thank you for using Appsaz!
</string>
    <string name="a_first_title">Welcome to Appsaz!</string>
    <string name="a_first_text">
You are currently using the free trial version of Appsaz, which comes with certain limitations. In this version, users can add up to 20 pages, 10 lists, and 10 fonts to their projects. However, there are no restrictions on adding multimedia files such as images, videos, and audios. Additionally, only Google AdMob banner ads are supported in this version, and the Appsaz watermark is automatically included in the output apps. To unlock all features and remove limitations, users can upgrade to a premium user. This version is currently under development, and for more information or to upgrade, please reach out to our support team through the About Us section.
Thank you for using Appsaz!
</string>
